# Back on Track {4}{B}: "Return target creature or Vehicle card from your graveyard to the battlefield. Create a 1/1
# colorless Pilot creature token with 'This token saddles Mounts and crews Vehicles as though its power were 2 greater.'"
# (CR 701.1, 111.1). Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills Bot1's Ornithopter. On turn 3 Bot1 has Black Lotus and Mox Jet, four mana,
# and the spell is refused for want of the fifth (it costs five); with Mox Ruby the Lotus's three and the two Moxen pay it
# exactly (the pool is empty). The Ornithopter comes back, untapped, and a 1/1 colorless Pilot token joins it.

